          "description": "If you think the perfect, portable lunch doesn\u0026#039;t exist, then think again, because this recipe is about to blow your mind. That\u0026#039;s right, my Baked Salmon Sushi Cups are a delicious, on-the-go way to enjoy all of the flavors you love about sushi, but with a fun twist. These cups are loaded with tender salmon, sushi rice, and your favorite garnishes for an exciting take on the sushi bake trend. Plus, this recipe happens to be naturally gluten-free- woohoo!",
